  "queryImages": [],
  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "259",
  "tip": "<p>When a service explicitly supports <i>online</i> schema changes, prefer the native DDL path. Be wary of answers that add migrations, restores, or complex replication topologies because those usually increase <i>downtime</i> and risk without benefit.</p>",
